{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"Grouping four heads raised effective input/output bandwidth to roughly 5.5 TB/s on the largest case and made the arithmetic bit-exact. I’m now parameterizing the group size so I can benchmark 4 vs. 8 (and larger) locally without consuming a verification attempt, while keeping query/key groups separate when a head count is not divisible by the group size."}}
